  {
    "name": "oreLow-source-top",
    "rows": [
      {
        "text": "白階礦石｜獲取途徑",
        "font": 22,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "h3.",
        "parent": "v132-reward-modal-inner v17346-preview-modal"
      },
      {
        "text": "野怪區｜主城 → 野怪區 → 任一區域普通怪，5%機率取得 ×1（可重複）",
        "font": 16,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "p.",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "材料寶箱｜材料寶箱，取得機率尚未定案 ×10（可重複）；暫定分布20%；正式掉率待核定",
        "font": 16,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "p.",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "材料寶箱的獲取途徑",
        "font": 14,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "div.v132-preview-section-title",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "材料副本｜主城 → 副本 → 每日副本 → 材料副本，必定取得 ×1～3（可重複）；解鎖：任一角色Lv.10；通關3輪；總回合少於15給3箱、15～29給2箱、30以上給1箱；每日",
        "font": 16,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "p.",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "個人Boss｜首次赤焰君 Lv.20，必定取得 ×2；解鎖：至少一名角色達到Lv.20；通關後",
        "font": 16,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "p.",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "個人Boss｜赤焰君 Lv.20，必定取得 ×1（可重複）；解鎖：至少一名角色達到Lv.20；再戰通關；背包無法放入時改給500金幣",
        "font": 16,
        "button": false,
        "primary": false,
        "selector": "p.",
        "parent": "v132-preview-list v132-preview-list-scroll"
      },
      {
        "text": "返回",
        "font": 15,
        "button": true,
        "primary": true,
        "selector": "button.",
        "parent": "v132-reward-actions"
      }
    ],
    "controls": [
